{"id":"5955","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5955_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为中层云中广大的悬球状云区。其云属大概源于高层云；然而，该实例可确定为高积云，因为悬球状云正在变为圆形云团。附近的观测以及高空探测显示其云底高度为4000米（13000英尺）。</p>\n<p>在英国西部上空有缓慢移动、波动的冷锋。中层低压槽在英格兰南部上空向东北方向移动。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"02 July 2015 0846 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= /, CM= 7, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.15","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.15"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5955_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在英国西部上空有缓慢移动、波动的冷锋。中层低压槽在英格兰南部上空向东北方向移动。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5955_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-mamma_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测显示出在地表的稳定条件和中层云，云底高度约为15000–16000英尺。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5955_radar_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-mamma_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"></div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5955_sat_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-mamma_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这是英国英格兰拉克希尔1000 UTC（当地时间11:00）的温熵图。拉克希尔是在照片拍摄地以西。</p>\n<p>中层云云底现已降至9000英尺。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}